				2515,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Vine): Refresh README with simplified overview and consistent badge labels\n\nSimplify the project description from a technical deep-dive to a reader-friendly summary focused on Vine's role as Land's single communication layer. Relabel badge indicators for clarity (\"Update\" instead of \"Last-commit\", \"Issue\" singular, \"Download\" singular) and fix the downloads badge URL to include the `/total` path segment.\n\nThe revised overview foregrounds the single-source-of-truth design (Proto/Vine.proto) and reorders the component introduction to match Land's architectural hierarchy. Feature-gate documentation is streamlined to focus on compile-time choice rather than implementation detail.",
